usBorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LinusBorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-04-18T10:00:33Z","label":{"name":"has workaround","color":"98b8e0"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/821976601","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/3623#issuecomment-821976601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/3623","id":821976601,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyMTk3NjYwMQ==","user":{"login":"edison1105","id":3705199,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUxOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3705199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105","html_url":"https://github.com/edison1105","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-18T11:28:14Z","updated_at":"2021-04-19T01:14:07Z","body":"I don't think this has anything to do with element re-use, but rather the nested teleport not being unmounted correctly.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3705199/115144017-ec8d3c80-a07c-11eb-9167-d0bae70f55b1.png)\r\n\r\nWhen the el of Port1 was removed, Port2 was not removed correctly because it was mounted under pop.\r\nMy idea was to set optimized to false on unmount if it contained a nested teleport. this may not be a good solution, ~~so I didn't submit a PR.~~\r\n\r\nFinally, I submitted a PR and didn't think of a better way. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/821976601/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"edison1105","id":3705199,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUxOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3705199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105","html_url":"https://github.com/edison1105","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edison1105/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/822007461","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/3623#issuecomment-822007461","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/3623","id":822007461,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyMjAwNzQ2MQ==","user":{"login":"yunbookf","id":1802259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDIyNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1802259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf","html_url":"https://github.com/yunbookf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-18T15:14:11Z","updated_at":"2021-04-18T15:14:11Z","body":"> This seems to be more an issue caused by the element re-use between v-if and v-else. Adding a `key` can be used as a workaround:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> <div id=\"app\">\r\n>     <div v-if=\"mode\">\r\n> \t\tMode 1\r\n> \t\t<teleport to=\"#pop\" :disabled=\"dis\">\r\n> \t\t\t<div class=\"port\" :key=\"1\">\r\n> \t\t\t\tPort 1\r\n> \t\t\t\t<teleport to=\"#pop\" :disabled=\"dis\">\r\n> \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"port\" style=\"left: 200px;\" :key=\"1\">\r\n> \t\t\t\t\t\tPort 2\r\n> \t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n>         </teleport>\r\n> \t\t\t</div>\r\n> \t\t</teleport>\r\n> \t</div>\r\n> \t<div v-else>\r\n> \t\tMode 2\r\n> \t\t<teleport to=\"#pop\" :disabled=\"dis\">\r\n> \t\t\t<div class=\"port\" :key=\"2\">\r\n> \t\t\t\tPort 3\r\n> \t\t\t\t<teleport to=\"#pop\" :disabled=\"dis\">\r\n> \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"port\" style=\"left: 200px;\" :key=\"2\">\r\n> \t\t\t\t\t\tPort 4\r\n> \t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n> \t\t\t\t</teleport>\r\n> \t\t\t</div>\r\n> \t\t</teleport>\r\n> \t</div>\r\n> \t<div>\r\n> \t\t<input type=\"button\" @click=\"mode = !mode\" value=\"Change mode\" /> <input type=\"button\" @click=\"dis = !dis\" value=\"Change disabled\" />\r\n> \t</div>\r\n>   <div>Click \"Change mode\" button multiple times, u can see a lot of \"port2\" and \"port4\", which is obviously not right.</div>\r\n> </div>\r\n> <div id=\"pop\"></div>\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nI also don't think it has an issue with element re-use, I've written a new demo that doesn't involve v-if and v-else, and after clicking \"Unmounted\", only the first layer of teleport is destroyed.\r\n\r\nThe new link is: [https://codepen.io/jsqy/pen/MWJqWLN](https://codepen.io/jsqy/pen/MWJqWLN)\r\n\r\nExamples written using v-if in the topic post are simply simplified problem reproduction, which is more complicated when combined with components, and the use of \":key\"'s \"workaround\" does not solve the problem.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/822007461/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"yunbookf","id":1802259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDIyNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1802259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf","html_url":"https://github.com/yunbookf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunbookf/starred{/ow